<p>Notes:</p>
<p>(A) Represents the contractual reduction of officers compensation following the acquisition of ISS.</p>
<p>(B) Prior to December 31, 1996, ISS was an S corporation and prior to April 3, 1995, Renaissance was a limited partnership.  Pro forma income taxes represent the income taxes that would have been provided on pro forma income before taxes if ISS and Renaissance had been C corporations for the periods presented.</p>
<p>Note: Full company name is Renaissance Solutions Inc.</p>
<p>(Amount in thousands, except per share data)</p>
